<Slide>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', background: '#F8FAFC', padding: '60px 60px 60px 60px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#2563EB', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>06</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0B1E3F', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>应用对话界面</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 14, marginBottom: 28 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 0.9, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #E8EDF5', padding: '22px 24px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
          <FAIcon name='desktop' style={{ fill: '#2563EB', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1E293B', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>应用描述</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
          咕嘎是一只常驻桌面的企鹅桌宠，通过<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB' }}>自然语言对话</span>即可触发学习。用户无需记住任何命令或数字键，只要说出「教我」「帮我弄懂」「我想学」，咕嘎就会自动进入助教模式，完成讲解、出题、复习的完整闭环。
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E3A8A', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>核心交互特点</Text>
          {['语言触发，无需菜单', '截图即学，自动提炼', '长回答自动存文档+导图', '语音朗读 + 可打断'].map((s, i) => (
            <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
              <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 6, borderRadius: 3, background: '#2563EB' }} />
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#334155' }}>{s}</Text>
            </Box>
          ))}
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1.1, background: '#0B1E3F', borderRadius: 14, padding: '24px 24px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 4 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 34, height: 34, borderRadius: 17, background: '#2563EB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <FAIcon name='user' style={{ fill: '#FFFFFF', width: 18, height: 18 }} />
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#BFDBFE', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>对话界面示意</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ alignSelf: 'flex-end', background: '#2563EB', borderRadius: 12, padding: '12px 16px', width: 180 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>帮我弄懂递归</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ alignSelf: 'flex-start', background: '#1E293B', borderRadius: 12, padding: '12px 16px', width: 380 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
            好呀～递归就是「函数自己调用自己」！我用「俄罗斯套娃」给你拆解，再出几道题巩固，要不要先来张思维导图？
          </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ alignSelf: 'flex-start', background: '#1E293B', borderRadius: 12, padding: '12px 16px', width: 380, marginTop: 2 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
            讲解文档已生成 · runtime/study/递归.md<br/>思维导图已生成 · 递归.mindmap.html<br/>已出 3 道自适应练习题
          </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginTop: 6 }}>
          <FAIcon name='microphone' style={{ fill: '#64748B', width: 20, height: 20 }} />
          <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 40, borderRadius: 20, background: '#0F2A52', justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 16 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>输入你的问题…</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
